window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["story-v-y2v9.5-index"]=[{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p11-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka satou-maya karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  bedridden with the flu on christmas eve ayanokoji tries to call her  after an hour she calls back  coughing  with one word    influenza  she had wanted to keep the 24th promise even crawling  but he urges her to rest and reschedule  he confirms a friend has bought her everything she needs   influenza  sato calls to check on her  kei has recovered and gone out  and sato is relieved  dependent and eager to keep promises   sick as she is she still wants to meet  but she accepts rest  reschedules their christmas promise with him  her best friend checks on her flu","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p11-1\">Kei: bedridden with the flu<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.11–13, 106<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On Christmas Eve Ayanokōji tries to call her; after an hour she calls back, coughing, with one word — &quot;Influenza.&quot; She had wanted to keep the 24th promise even crawling, but he urges her to rest and reschedule; he confirms a friend has bought her everything she needs. Satō calls to check on her; Kei has recovered and gone out, and Satō is relieved.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Influenza.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Dependent and eager to keep promises — sick as she is she still wants to meet, but she accepts rest.<span class=\"pg\">p.11–13, 106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reschedules their Christmas promise with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.11–13<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Her best friend checks on her flu.<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1\">→ After: Kei: venting to Satō over the &quot;cold war&quot;<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9_5-p15-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka akiyama mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari mashima  gym training  and a favor to investigate akiyama at the gym he is pleased to find ayanokoji is now a member  shows him his bench press routine  80 100 kg  using safety bars  trains absorbed for two hours and accepts ayanokoji s advice to stop   hm  ayanokoji  are you a gym member too   when doing bench presses  never forget these safety bars  in the break room he asks ayanokoji to investigate a gym employee  akiyama   whether she has a boyfriend  her type and hobbies   explaining he dismissed hoshinomiya and chabashira as too flirtatious serious and picked ayanokoji as discreet and trustworthy   i want you to investigate her  as carefully and discreetly as possible   you re the only one who goes to the gym  remains discreet  and seems trustworthy  cheerful and dedicated to training but secretly smitten   he delegates a discreet investigation rather than confess himself  showing a calculating side behind the simple enthusiasm  gym buddy whom he trusts with a personal favor  the gym employee he is interested in  asks ayanokoji to investigate her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9_5-p15-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html#sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9_5-p15-1\">Mashima: gym training, and a favor to investigate Akiyama<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.15–23<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the gym he is pleased to find Ayanokōji is now a member, shows him his bench-press routine (80–100 kg, using safety bars), trains absorbed for two hours and accepts Ayanokōji&#x27;s advice to stop. In the break room he asks Ayanokōji to investigate a gym employee, Akiyama — whether she has a boyfriend, her type and hobbies — explaining he dismissed Hoshinomiya and Chabashira as too flirtatious/serious and picked Ayanokōji as discreet and trustworthy.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/akiyama.html\">Akiyama<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> &quot;Hm? Ayanokōji? Are you a gym member too?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> &quot;When doing bench presses, never forget these safety bars.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> &quot;I want you to investigate her. As carefully and discreetly as possible.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;re the only one who goes to the gym, remains discreet, and seems trustworthy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful and dedicated to training but secretly smitten — he delegates a discreet Investigation rather than confess himself, showing a calculating side behind the simple enthusiasm.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Gym buddy whom he trusts with a personal favor.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Akiyama<\/b> The gym employee he is interested in; asks Ayanokōji to investigate her.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-akiyama-y2v9_5-p20-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"mashima-tomonari akiyama","q":"akiyama akiyama  the gym employee mashima is smitten with named and briefly on site   a gym employee who checks that mashima has not overworked himself  notices ayanokoji with him  and says they have met at the reception before  mashima later asks ayanokoji to investigate her   mashima san  you overworked yourself again today  didn t you  attentive to mashima s training  the object of his unspoken interest  he asks ayanokoji to investigate whether she has a boyfriend and her tastes","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-akiyama-y2v9_5-p20-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/akiyama.html#sc-akiyama-y2v9_5-p20-1\">Akiyama: the gym employee Mashima is smitten with<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.20–23<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/akiyama.html\">Akiyama<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named and briefly on-site — a gym employee who checks that Mashima has not overworked himself, notices Ayanokōji with him, and says they have met at the reception before; Mashima later asks Ayanokōji to investigate her.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Akiyama<\/b> &quot;Mashima-san, you overworked yourself again today, didn&#x27;t you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Attentive to Mashima&#x27;s training; the object of his unspoken interest.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> He asks Ayanokōji to investigate whether she has a boyfriend and her tastes.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p26-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami shiranami-chihiro","q":"shiranami chihiro shiranami  a heartbreak song and questions about ichinose ayanokoji finds her in a rental shop wearing headphones  listening to a melancholic heartbreak song  startled  she takes them off and asks what he wants   w w what do you want  she asks to talk somewhere that won t stand out  then leads him to a vending machine rest area where she keeps a deliberate distance and refuses a drink or a seat   um  do you have a little time  right now  she presses him on his relationship with ichinose   are they just friends  is there romance   and voices the rumors about the gym and his room  she reveals she feels she has been  an unpleasant girl  for venting   what is your relationship with honami chan  ayanokoji kun   i m kind of an unpleasant girl  huh  she thanks him for helping her during the uninhabited island exam and stammers that it isn t that she dislikes him  jealous and lovesick over ichinose  but self aware and apologetic   she is careful not to be seen with a boy  yet desperate to confirm ayanokoji s feelings  questions him closely about ichinose  trusts him enough to ask  worried that ichinose is falling for ayanokoji  brings up the gym room rumors","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p26-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html#sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p26-1\">Shiranami: a heartbreak song and questions about Ichinose<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.26–35<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji finds her in a rental shop wearing headphones, listening to a melancholic heartbreak song; startled, she takes them off and asks what he wants. She asks to talk somewhere that won&#x27;t stand out, then leads him to a vending-machine rest area where she keeps a deliberate distance and refuses a drink or a seat. She presses him on his relationship with Ichinose — are they just friends, is there romance — and voices the rumors about the gym and his room; she reveals she feels she has been &quot;an unpleasant girl&quot; for venting. She thanks him for helping her during the uninhabited island exam and stammers that it isn&#x27;t that she dislikes him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;W-w-what do you want?!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;Um... do you have a little time... right now...?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;What is your relationship with Honami-chan, Ayanokōji-kun?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m kind of an unpleasant girl, huh?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Jealous and lovesick over Ichinose, but self-aware and apologetic — she is careful not to be seen with a boy, yet desperate to confirm Ayanokōji&#x27;s feelings.<span class=\"pg\">p.26–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Questions him closely about Ichinose; trusts him enough to ask.<span class=\"pg\">p.30–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Worried that Ichinose is falling for Ayanokōji; brings up the gym/room rumors.<span class=\"pg\">p.30–35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p156-1\">→ After: Shiranami: the library outing and Kamuro&#x27;s warning<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p59-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiranami-chihiro nanase-tsubasa ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ichinose  the 46 photo memory day at keyaki mall on christmas she takes photos with everyone at keyaki mall   43 people by one count  eventually 46   and shyly asks ayanokoji for a photo together  to make memories  careful that many photos  not just one with a boy  avoid a rift with kei   hey  ayanokoji kun  could you take a picture with me   to make some memories  i took pictures with various people here today  she asks after ayanokoji s meeting with chihiro the day before  and is joined by nanase and hosen  she waves him off as she smoothly turns to the next photo request   by the way  ayanokoji kun  you met with chihiro chan yesterday  right  cheerful  sociable and principled   she turns the holiday into a memory making marathon and cleverly protects both herself and ayanokoji from rumors by keeping the photos public  takes a commemorative photo with him  asks about his talk with shiranami  refers to her as  chihiro chan  showing closeness  joins for a photo  nanase also brings hosen","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p59-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p59-1\">Ichinose: the 46-photo memory day at Keyaki Mall<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.59–65<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On Christmas she takes photos with everyone at Keyaki Mall — 43 people by one count, eventually 46 — and shyly asks Ayanokōji for a photo together &quot;to make memories,&quot; careful that many photos (not just one with a boy) avoid a rift with Kei. She asks after Ayanokōji&#x27;s meeting with Chihiro the day before, and is joined by Nanase and Hōsen; she waves him off as she smoothly turns to the next photo request.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Hey, Ayanokōji-kun, could you take a picture with me?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;To make some memories, I took pictures with various people here today.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;By the way, Ayanokōji-kun, you met with Chihiro-chan yesterday, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful, sociable and principled — she turns the holiday into a memory-making marathon and cleverly protects both herself and Ayanokōji from rumors by keeping the photos public.<span class=\"pg\">p.59–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Takes a commemorative photo with him; asks about his talk with Shiranami.<span class=\"pg\">p.61–63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> Refers to her as &quot;Chihiro-chan,&quot; showing closeness.<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> Joins for a photo; Nanase also brings Hōsen.<span class=\"pg\">p.63–65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shinohara-satsuki ike-kanji","q":"ike kanji ike  defending ayanokoji in the class meeting at maezono s gathering he defends ayanokoji as no troublemaker  insists he isn t just gloomy since he dates karuizawa  and even offers to test his fighting ability with a sneak attack  shinohara and maezono shoot him down  he studies the displayed oaa with a serious expression   who knows  i m pretty confident in my fighting skills  loyal and defensive of ayanokoji  but his bluster about fighting is exposed as empty  defends him against the group s suspicion  she tells him to sit down  exasperated by his posturing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html#sc-ike-kanji-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Ike: defending Ayanokōji in the class meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–78<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At Maezono&#x27;s gathering he defends Ayanokōji as no troublemaker, insists he isn&#x27;t just gloomy since he dates Karuizawa, and even offers to test his fighting ability with a sneak attack; Shinohara and Maezono shoot him down.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> &quot;Who knows? I&#x27;m pretty confident in my fighting skills.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He studies the displayed OAA with a serious expression.<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Loyal and defensive of Ayanokōji, but his bluster about fighting is exposed as empty.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Defends him against the group&#x27;s suspicion.<span class=\"pg\">p.68–76<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> She tells him to sit down, exasperated by his posturing.<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-maezono-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki ike-kanji maezono","q":"maezono maezono  the secret meeting to size up ayanokoji she gathers a small group  ike  sudo  shinohara  matsushita  mori  wang  maezono  onodera  at keyaki mall  deliberately excluding karuizawa and her close friends  and opens the discussion of ayanokoji   whom she says she dislikes as  dark and hard to get along with   to be honest  perhaps it s problematic for me to say this  but i don t like   that s true  but i don t like dark and hard to get along with people  i feel  she argues his oaa understates his real ability  he solved hard questions in the special exam  was fast in the relay  is a strategic threat  warns that he named sakura for expulsion  and opposes making him the class s leader   though she cannot name an alternative   i heard this from someone else  but  during the uninhabited island exam   i strongly oppose ayanokoji kun being the leader  perceptive and outspoken   she sees through ayanokoji s facade and organizes the meeting to decide how the class should treat him  but remains evasive when asked for her own preferred leader  the subject of the meeting  she senses he is  hiding  something  co organizer who agrees with her  defends ayanokoji  she challenges him sharply","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-maezono-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html#sc-maezono-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Maezono: the secret meeting to size up Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–80<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She gathers a small group (Ike, Sudō, Shinohara, Matsushita, Mori, Wang, Maezono, Onodera) at Keyaki Mall, deliberately excluding Karuizawa and her close friends, and opens the discussion of Ayanokōji — whom she says she dislikes as &quot;dark and hard-to-get-along-with.&quot; She argues his OAA understates his real ability (he solved hard questions in the special exam, was fast in the relay, is a strategic threat), warns that he named Sakura for expulsion, and opposes making him the class&#x27;s leader — though she cannot name an alternative.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;To be honest, perhaps it&#x27;s problematic for me to say this, but I don&#x27;t like...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;That&#x27;s true, but I don&#x27;t like dark and hard-to-get-along-with people... I feel&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;I heard this from someone else, but... during the uninhabited island exam&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I strongly oppose Ayanokōji-kun being the leader.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Perceptive and outspoken — she sees through Ayanokōji&#x27;s facade and organizes the meeting to decide how the class should treat him, but remains evasive when asked for her own preferred leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> The subject of the meeting; she senses he is &quot;hiding&quot; something.<span class=\"pg\">p.68–79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> Co-organizer who agrees with her.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Defends Ayanokōji; she challenges him sharply.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–72<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"maezono ike-kanji matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita  in on maezono s ayanokoji meeting she attends maezono s secret gathering  nods along as the group questions whether ayanokoji is really just a gloomy classmate  and sides with maezono in challenging ike s defense of him   ahem  thank you everyone for gathering today   lately  you ve been talking to ayanokoji a lot  haven t you  when did you  a participant in the class s attempt to understand ayanokoji  she notes his changed interactions and presses ike on his closeness to him  attends the meeting she called  questions his recent frequent contact with ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html#sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Matsushita: in on Maezono&#x27;s Ayanokōji meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–77<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She attends Maezono&#x27;s secret gathering, nods along as the group questions whether Ayanokōji is really just a gloomy classmate, and sides with Maezono in challenging Ike&#x27;s defense of him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;Ahem, thank you everyone for gathering today.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> &quot;Lately, you&#x27;ve been talking to Ayanokōji a lot, haven&#x27;t you? When did you...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A participant in the class&#x27;s attempt to understand Ayanokōji; she notes his changed interactions and presses Ike on his closeness to him.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> Attends the meeting she called.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Questions his recent frequent contact with Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji shinohara-satsuki","q":"shinohara satsuki shinohara  in on the ayanokoji discussion she attends maezono s gathering  is teased about the public  lovey dovey  display with ike  and bluntly tells him off when he postures about fighting ayanokoji   you ve never been in a proper fight  have you  pragmatic and unimpressed by ike s bravado  shuts down his fighting boast","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html#sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Shinohara: in on the Ayanokōji discussion<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–77<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She attends Maezono&#x27;s gathering, is teased about the public &quot;lovey-dovey&quot; display with Ike, and bluntly tells him off when he postures about fighting Ayanokōji.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;ve never been in a proper fight, have you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Pragmatic and unimpressed by Ike&#x27;s bravado.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Shuts down his fighting boast.<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sudou-ken-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka onodera maezono sudou-ken","q":"sudo ken sudo  defending ayanokoji s ability in the class meeting at maezono s secret gathering he reveals he once fought ayanokoji and lost  argues his physical ability and speed exceed even his own  and defends the sakura expulsion as an unavoidable decision  his classmates notice how much more mature his speech has become   you guys saw it too  right  ayanokoji s speed in the relay race  he s faster   if i can beat him in anything  it s probably just basketball  and even then   i mean  if it was the previous sudo kun  you wouldn t have been able to say  candid and fair   he acknowledges ayanokoji s superiority without jealousy and has matured enough to reason about his decisions and notice others  growth  lost a fight to him  credits his speed and overall ability  onodera agrees that his speech has matured and looks pleased on his behalf  discusses whether ayanokoji should lead the class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html#sc-sudou-ken-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Sudō: defending Ayanokōji&#x27;s ability in the class meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–78<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At Maezono&#x27;s secret gathering he reveals he once fought Ayanokōji and lost, argues his physical ability and speed exceed even his own, and defends the Sakura expulsion as an unavoidable decision; his classmates notice how much more mature his speech has become.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/onodera.html\">Onodera<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;You guys saw it too, right? Ayanokōji&#x27;s speed in the relay race. He&#x27;s faster...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;If I can beat him in anything, it&#x27;s probably just basketball. And even then...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;I mean, if it was the previous Sudō-kun, you wouldn&#x27;t have been able to say...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Candid and fair — he acknowledges Ayanokōji&#x27;s superiority without jealousy and has matured enough to reason about his decisions and notice others&#x27; growth.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Lost a fight to him; credits his speed and overall ability.<span class=\"pg\">p.74–75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Onodera<\/b> Onodera agrees that his speech has matured and looks pleased on his behalf.<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> Discusses whether Ayanokōji should lead the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v9_5-p80-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"kamuro-masumi ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiina-hiyori hashimoto-masayoshi","q":"hashimoto masayoshi hashimoto  eavesdropping and probing ayanokoji he tells kamuro he eavesdropped on class 2 d s discussion of ayanokoji  concluding horikita is not really the core of class b and that ayanokoji can make ruthless decisions   horikita isn t the core of class b after all  in the new year group outing with hiyori  kamuro and kito  he teases hiyori  tries to hit on her  then questions ayanokoji about whether he will ditch kei for her and whether he is class b s  true leader  and proposes class a headhunt him   so  do you plan to ditch karuizawa and switch to shiina   show us  ayanokoji  if you prove your strength to us in class a  we ll use  nosy and provocative   he gathers intel on rivals and openly tests ayanokoji s loyalties and strength  acting as class a s mood maker instigator  his partner in eavesdropping and the outing  she repeatedly rebukes him  probes his relationship and strength  proposes headhunting him to class a  hits on her  she is unfazed","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v9_5-p80-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html#sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v9_5-p80-1\">Hashimoto: eavesdropping and probing Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.80–81, 189–203<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He tells Kamuro he eavesdropped on Class 2-D&#x27;s discussion of Ayanokōji, concluding Horikita is not really the core of Class B and that Ayanokōji can make ruthless decisions. In the new-year group outing with Hiyori, Kamuro and Kitō, he teases Hiyori, tries to hit on her, then questions Ayanokōji about whether he will ditch Kei for her and whether he is Class B&#x27;s &quot;true leader,&quot; and proposes Class A headhunt him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html\">Kamuro Masumi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> &quot;Horikita isn&#x27;t the core of Class B after all.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> &quot;So, do you plan to ditch Karuizawa and switch to Shiina?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> &quot;Show us, Ayanokōji. If you prove your strength to us in Class A, we&#x27;ll use...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.202<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Nosy and provocative — he gathers intel on rivals and openly tests Ayanokōji&#x27;s loyalties and strength, acting as Class A&#x27;s mood-maker/instigator.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> His partner in eavesdropping and the outing; she repeatedly rebukes him.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Probes his relationship and strength; proposes headhunting him to Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.192–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Hits on her; she is unfazed.<span class=\"pg\">p.197–198<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v9_5-p80-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi shiina-hiyori sakayanagi-arisu kamuro-masumi","q":"kamuro masumi kamuro  intel  warnings and probing ayanokoji she listens to hashimoto s eavesdropping report but says she already knew much of it  she is dismissive of his casual charm   i knew some of it to some extent  on the library outing she warns hiyori that being seen with ayanokoji looks abnormal  then interrogates him about snooping around class a  morishita  and says he is the only one who can influence sakayanagi   it seems like you re being quite ostentatious early in the new year   you re the only one who can influence sakayanagi  at the group outing she is impatient with hashimoto s hectoring  calls kito a  rare specimen  and leaves rather than join his  rampage  admitting she still dislikes sakayanagi but must think of the class  sharp  blunt and pragmatic   she collects and weighs information  watches appearances  and acts in class a s interest despite personal dislike of its leader  her classmate  rebukes his antics repeatedly  warns her about being seen with ayanokoji  dislikes her personally but now thinks in the class s interest","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v9_5-p80-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html#sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v9_5-p80-1\">Kamuro: intel, warnings and probing Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.80–81, 189–203<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html\">Kamuro Masumi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She listens to Hashimoto&#x27;s eavesdropping report but says she already knew much of it; she is dismissive of his casual charm. On the library outing she warns Hiyori that being seen with Ayanokōji looks abnormal, then interrogates him about snooping around Class A (Morishita) and says he is the only one who can influence Sakayanagi. At the group outing she is impatient with Hashimoto&#x27;s hectoring, calls Kitō a &quot;rare specimen,&quot; and leaves rather than join his &quot;rampage,&quot; admitting she still dislikes Sakayanagi but must think of the class.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> &quot;I knew some of it to some extent.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> &quot;It seems like you&#x27;re being quite ostentatious early in the new year.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;re the only one who can influence Sakayanagi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.193<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sharp, blunt and pragmatic — she collects and weighs information, watches appearances, and acts in Class A&#x27;s interest despite personal dislike of its leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Her classmate; rebukes his antics repeatedly.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Warns her about being seen with Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.189–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Dislikes her personally but now thinks in the class&#x27;s interest.<span class=\"pg\">p.193, 203<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v9_5-p113-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ryuuen-kakeru katsuragi-kouhei","q":"katsuragi kohei katsuragi  the leaked warning of a dangerous third term exam ryuen summons him and ayanokoji  as they walk to the meeting he shares that ryuen calls them out unilaterally  then confides his read of the class   ryuen s strength and the  strange  students he deliberately doesn t use   trusting ayanokoji with the secret   it s a bad habit of ryuen to unilaterally call us out whenever something   you ve become quite the strategist  it seems that even ryuen trusts your  they compare sources   kiryuin of class 3 b and ibeyama of class 3 d both leaked  three days earlier  that a risky special exam may come at the start of the third term  they discuss class voting  multiple expulsions  and whom to target  then part with katsuragi offering to help if ayanokoji has problems   there will be several special exams in the third term one in early january   i owe you a lot  ayanokoji  if you have any problems  feel free to consult  serious and strategic   he shares intelligence candidly  weighing who benefits from the leak and how to protect the class  and openly values ayanokoji  trusts him with class secrets and thanks him  his class leader  summoned by him  he analyses his intentions","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v9_5-p113-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html#sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v9_5-p113-1\">Katsuragi: the leaked warning of a dangerous third-term exam<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.113–128<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ryūen summons him and Ayanokōji; as they walk to the meeting he shares that Ryūen calls them out unilaterally, then confides his read of the class — Ryūen&#x27;s strength and the &quot;strange&quot; students he deliberately doesn&#x27;t use — trusting Ayanokōji with the secret. They compare sources — Kiryūin of Class 3-B and Ibeyama of Class 3-D both leaked, three days earlier, that a risky special exam may come at the start of the third term; they discuss class voting, multiple expulsions, and whom to target, then part with Katsuragi offering to help if Ayanokōji has problems.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s a bad habit of Ryūen to unilaterally call us out whenever something...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;ve become quite the strategist. It seems that even Ryūen trusts your...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;There will be several special exams in the third term—one in early January...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I owe you a lot, Ayanokōji. If you have any problems, feel free to consult...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.127<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Serious and strategic — he shares intelligence candidly, weighing who benefits from the leak and how to protect the class, and openly values Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Trusts him with class secrets and thanks him.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> His class leader; summoned by him, he analyses his intentions.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–122<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9_5-p113-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"katsuragi-kouhei ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakayanagi-arisu ryuuen-kakeru","q":"ryuen kakeru ryuen  the summoned meeting on the third term exam he abruptly calls ayanokoji and katsuragi out to keyaki mall   ordering ayanokoji to postpone his plans   and tears into a cake when they arrive  brushing off the suggestion that he apologize   hey  answer it faster when i call   shouldn t you apologize to ayanokoji at least  he reveals he heard from third years that a big  risky exam looms at the start of the third term  he wants a one on one shot at sakayanagi in the final exam rather than a class vote  and parts telling ayanokoji their match is in the third year   in the next special exam  if the rules allow a one on one battle  i ll take on   our match will be in the third year  don t forget that  pushy and aggressive as ever   self centered in his summons  dismissive of etiquette  and intent on humiliating sakayanagi directly  his lieutenant  whom he also summons  they debate strategy  calls him out and reminds him of their pending match  wants to defeat her personally in the final exam","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9_5-p113-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html#sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9_5-p113-1\">Ryūen: the summoned meeting on the third-term exam<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.113–128<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He abruptly calls Ayanokōji and Katsuragi out to Keyaki Mall — ordering Ayanokōji to postpone his plans — and tears into a cake when they arrive, brushing off the suggestion that he apologize. He reveals he heard from third-years that a big, risky exam looms at the start of the third term; he wants a one-on-one shot at Sakayanagi in the final exam rather than a class vote, and parts telling Ayanokōji their match is in the third year.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Hey, answer it faster when I call.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.113<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Shouldn&#x27;t you apologize to Ayanokōji at least?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;In the next special exam, if the rules allow a one-on-one battle, I&#x27;ll take on...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Our match will be in the third year. Don&#x27;t forget that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Pushy and aggressive as ever — self-centered in his summons, dismissive of etiquette, and intent on humiliating Sakayanagi directly.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> His lieutenant, whom he also summons; they debate strategy.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Calls him out and reminds him of their pending match.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Wants to defeat her personally in the final exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.121–122<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"satou-maya ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  venting to sato over the  cold war  at keyaki mall she thanks sato for coming out  admits she told ayanokoji she is better and they agreed to talk about their promise  but worries he may have started liking ichinose   kiyotaka might actually have started to like ichinose san   it can be serious for some people  you know  sato takes her hand to make her forget the unpleasant things  kei calls her a truly good friend  still insecure about ichinose despite the recovery   she needs reassurance and leans on sato  grabs her hand  calls her a  truly good friend  fears he now likes ichinose","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1\">Kei: venting to Satō over the &quot;cold war&quot;<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.123–126<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At Keyaki Mall she thanks Satō for coming out, admits she told Ayanokōji she is better and they agreed to talk about their promise, but worries he may have started liking Ichinose. Satō takes her hand to make her forget the unpleasant things; Kei calls her a truly good friend.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Kiyotaka might actually have started to like Ichinose-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;It can be serious for some people, you know.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Still insecure about Ichinose despite the recovery — she needs reassurance and leans on Satō.<span class=\"pg\">p.123–126<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Grabs her hand; calls her a &quot;truly good friend.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Fears he now likes Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p11-1\">← Before: Kei: bedridden with the flu<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1\">→ After: Kei: Christmas date, necklace and reconciliation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yamamura-miki-y2v9_5-p128-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ryuuen-kakeru yamamura-miki","q":"yamamura miki yamamura  tailing ayanokoji ayanokoji catches her hiding in a blind spot near a vending machine  she admits  by silence  that she has been following him for about ten minutes   and the day before as well   but he tells her ryuen and katsuragi did not notice   what are you doing in a place like that   really  i felt like ryuen kun was trying to lure me out  stealthy and anxious   she tails him out of concern about ryuen s trap and is flustered at being caught  she follows him  he calls her out gently  she fears he was trying to lure ayanokoji out","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yamamura-miki-y2v9_5-p128-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yamamura-miki.html#sc-yamamura-miki-y2v9_5-p128-1\">Yamamura: tailing Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.128–129<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yamamura-miki.html\">Yamamura Miki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji catches her hiding in a blind spot near a vending machine; she admits, by silence, that she has been following him for about ten minutes — and the day before as well — but he tells her Ryūen and Katsuragi did not notice.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yamamura Miki<\/b> &quot;What are you doing in a place like that?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yamamura Miki<\/b> &quot;Really? I felt like Ryūen-kun was trying to lure me out...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Stealthy and anxious — she tails him out of concern about Ryūen&#x27;s trap and is flustered at being caught.<span class=\"pg\">p.128–129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She follows him; he calls her out gently.<span class=\"pg\">p.128–129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> She fears he was trying to lure Ayanokōji out.<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiranami-chihiro karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  christmas date  necklace and reconciliation on their rescheduled date she meets ayanokoji at keyaki mall  still awkward after three weeks apart  and apologizes for the misunderstanding  he gives her the christmas present   the necklace she had searched for repeatedly   it s been a while   did i tell you  kiyotaka  that i wanted this  overjoyed  she asks to go back to the way things were  asks if she can really trust him  puts on the necklace and wraps her arms around him   so  it s really okay to  go back to the way things were   it s really  really okay to trust you  right  they head to karaoke  when yamamura appears at the vending machines kei links arms with him again  wanting meals  baths and sleep together as before  emotionally starved by the cold war   the necklace and his reassurance restore her completely  she is openly affectionate and wants their old closeness back  reconciles fully  accepts the necklace and asks to return to normal  spots her eavesdropping near the vending machine with a hand towel","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1\">Kei: Christmas date, necklace and reconciliation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.150–157<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On their rescheduled date she meets Ayanokōji at Keyaki Mall, still awkward after three weeks apart, and apologizes for the misunderstanding; he gives her the Christmas present — the necklace she had searched for repeatedly. Overjoyed, she asks to go back to the way things were, asks if she can really trust him, puts on the necklace and wraps her arms around him. They head to karaoke; when Yamamura appears at the vending machines Kei links arms with him again, wanting meals, baths and sleep together as before.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s been a while...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.150<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Did I tell you, Kiyotaka, that I wanted this...!?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;So, it&#x27;s really okay to… go back to the way things were?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It&#x27;s really, really okay to trust you, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Emotionally starved by the cold war — the necklace and his reassurance restore her completely; she is openly affectionate and wants their old closeness back.<span class=\"pg\">p.150–157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reconciles fully; accepts the necklace and asks to return to normal.<span class=\"pg\">p.150–157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> Spots her eavesdropping near the vending machine with a hand towel.<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1\">← Before: Kei: venting to Satō over the &quot;cold war&quot;<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p184-1\">→ After: Kei: anxious before his &quot;one day&quot; outing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p156-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"kamuro-masumi shiina-hiyori shiranami-chihiro","q":"shiranami chihiro shiranami  the library outing and kamuro s warning at the vending machines she admits she was eavesdropping  she is  good at catching such things  and noticed he made up with kei  she stays vague about sakayanagi s reaction   please don t worry about it  you seem to have made up with karuizawa san  on the library outing she asks whether kei approved  and learns ayanokoji told her to read a book to have a common topic  kamuro warns her that being seen with him looks abnormal  and she agrees to be careful   um  was karuizawa san okay with this  i mean  is she okay with you going   today  he invited me to hang out as a friend  careful about appearances and others  opinions   she checks kei s permission and takes kamuro s warning seriously  warns her that being seen with ayanokoji looks suspicious  ayanokoji s library companion  she notes they are close","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p156-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html#sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p156-1\">Shiranami: the library outing and Kamuro&#x27;s warning<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.156–157, 187–193<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the vending machines she admits she was eavesdropping (she is &quot;good at catching such things&quot;) and noticed he made up with Kei; she stays vague about Sakayanagi&#x27;s reaction. On the library outing she asks whether Kei approved, and learns Ayanokōji told her to read a book to have a common topic; Kamuro warns her that being seen with him looks abnormal, and she agrees to be careful.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html\">Kamuro Masumi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;Please don&#x27;t worry about it. You seem to have made up with Karuizawa-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;Um, was Karuizawa-san okay with this? I mean, is she okay with you going...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.187<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;Today, he invited me to hang out as a friend.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Careful about appearances and others&#x27; opinions — she checks Kei&#x27;s permission and takes Kamuro&#x27;s warning seriously.<span class=\"pg\">p.156–193<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> Warns her that being seen with Ayanokōji looks suspicious.<span class=\"pg\">p.189–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Ayanokōji&#x27;s library companion; she notes they are close.<span class=\"pg\">p.189, 193<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p26-1\">← Before: Shiranami: a heartbreak song and questions about Ichinose<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p161-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiina-hiyori","q":"shiina hiyori hiyori  guiding ayanokoji s reading in the library at the library over the new year she greets ayanokoji and offers to guide his book choice  she starts with famous mysteries  asking if he has read the glass key  and recommends a little known author   happy new year  ayanokoji kun   then please allow me to guide your choice  helpful and quietly proud of her literary knowledge   a  bookworm girl  who takes seriously the task of picking his next read  helps him choose books  glad he will visit again","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p161-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html#sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p161-1\">Hiyori: guiding Ayanokōji&#x27;s reading in the library<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.161–163<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the library over the New Year she greets Ayanokōji and offers to guide his book choice; she starts with famous mysteries (asking if he has read The Glass Key) and recommends a little-known author.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;Happy New Year, Ayanokōji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.161<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;Then please allow me to guide your choice.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.162<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Helpful and quietly proud of her literary knowledge — a &quot;bookworm girl&quot; who takes seriously the task of picking his next read.<span class=\"pg\">p.161–163<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Helps him choose books; glad he will visit again.<span class=\"pg\">p.161–163<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p186-1\">→ After: Hiyori: the library outing and her father&#x27;s book<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p184-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  anxious before his  one day  outing she clings to him  anxious about the day long condition he set  only for today  and demands a kiss before letting him go   make sure you come back by tonight  okay   then give me a kiss  possessive and anxious   still shaken by the ichinose rumors  she needs reassurance before letting him out alone  reluctantly lets him go for the day","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p184-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p184-1\">Kei: anxious before his &quot;one day&quot; outing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.184–185<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She clings to him, anxious about the day-long condition he set (&quot;only for today&quot;), and demands a kiss before letting him go.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Make sure you come back by tonight, okay?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Then give me a kiss!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Possessive and anxious — still shaken by the Ichinose rumors, she needs reassurance before letting him out alone.<span class=\"pg\">p.184–185<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reluctantly lets him go for the day.<span class=\"pg\">p.184–185<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1\">← Before: Kei: Christmas date, necklace and reconciliation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p186-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei hashimoto-masayoshi shiina-hiyori","q":"shiina hiyori hiyori  the library outing and her father s book ayanokoji escorts her from the library  she asks whether kei approved of them being together  and learns he told kei to read a book so they would have a common topic   um  was karuizawa san okay with this  i mean  is she okay with you going  at the group outing with hashimoto  kamuro and kito she calls koenji like kito a  good guy  listens to the class a students probe ayanokoji  then reveals the book she gave him was written by her father  shiina katsumi   shiina katsumi  my father s name  she gives ayanokoji another of her father s books as a gift   one she had carried around daily and that is not in the library   and is anxious he will accept it  gentle  considerate and a little shy   checks kei s permission  sees good in others  and is quietly proud of her writer father while nervous about giving his book  he escorts her and recommends books  she gifts him her father s book  she is careful to check kei approved the outing  teases her and joins the group  she calls him and kito  rare specimens","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p186-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html#sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p186-1\">Hiyori: the library outing and her father&#x27;s book<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.186–207<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji escorts her from the library; she asks whether Kei approved of them being together, and learns he told Kei to read a book so they would have a common topic. At the group outing with Hashimoto, Kamuro and Kitō she calls Kōenji-like Kitō a &quot;good guy,&quot; listens to the Class A students probe Ayanokōji, then reveals the book she gave him was written by her father, Shiina Katsumi. She gives Ayanokōji another of her father&#x27;s books as a gift — one she had carried around daily and that is not in the library — and is anxious he will accept it.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;Um, was Karuizawa-san okay with this? I mean, is she okay with you going...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.187<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;Shiina Katsumi. My father&#x27;s name.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.205<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Gentle, considerate and a little shy — checks Kei&#x27;s permission, sees good in others, and is quietly proud of her writer father while nervous about giving his book.<span class=\"pg\">p.186–210<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He escorts her and recommends books; she gifts him her father&#x27;s book.<span class=\"pg\">p.161–210<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> She is careful to check Kei approved the outing.<span class=\"pg\">p.187<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Teases her and joins the group; she calls him and Kitō &quot;rare specimens.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.197–203<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p161-1\">← Before: Hiyori: guiding Ayanokōji&#x27;s reading in the library<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9_5-p211-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakayanagi-arisu","q":"sakayanagi arisu sakayanagi s new year resolve  pov  in her own viewpoint she follows reports of ayanokoji leaving the dorms with hiyori  notes karuizawa and kamuro also tailing him  and reflects that she never expected to feel something for anyone   she recognises his ability and resolves to defeat him to prove her own talent  this is sakayanagi s interior monologue  her pov  no line is quoted as spoken  cold  competitive and self aware   she admits a rare emotion toward ayanokoji and turns it into a goal to beat him  she has him followed and resolves to defeat him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9_5-p211-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html#sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9_5-p211-1\">Sakayanagi&#x27;s new-year resolve (POV)<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.211–216<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In her own viewpoint she follows reports of Ayanokōji leaving the dorms with Hiyori, notes Karuizawa and Kamuro also tailing him, and reflects that she never expected to feel something for anyone — she recognises his ability and resolves to defeat him to prove her own talent.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> This is Sakayanagi&#x27;s interior monologue (her POV); no line is quoted as spoken.<span class=\"pg\">p.211–216<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cold, competitive and self-aware — she admits a rare emotion toward Ayanokōji and turns it into a goal to beat him.<span class=\"pg\">p.211–216<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She has him followed and resolves to defeat him.<span class=\"pg\">p.211–216<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"}];
